OL,3,GNEWSAMurder trial told motorist swerved
OL,4,Aat cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver in a Mercedes deliberately
OL,7,Fswerved into a cyclist following an
OL,8,Faltercation over the rider hitting the
OL,9,Fcar's wing mirror, a court has heard.
OL,11,FDavid Morgan, 40, admits manslaughter
OL,12,Fbut denies the murder of Richard Smith
OL,13,Fon 8 May in Chartwell Road, Norwich.
OL,15,FA jury at Norwich Crown Court was shown
OL,16,FCCTV footage from after the collision
OL,17,Fin which Morgan, of George Winter
OL,18,FCourt, Norwich, said "I ain't having
OL,19,Fit, no [expletive] is going to touch my
OL,20,Fcar" and admitted "swerving into him".
