OL,4,Aat cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors said Morgan had been
OL,7,Fdrinking during the day before he
OL,8,Fknocked the 50-year-old off his bike,
OL,9,Fand that his children were in the car
OL,10,Fat the time.
